      "id": 1,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Hey, how have you been? We should meet up soon!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:32:34.793853+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I've been really busy with work lately! It's hard to find time for our usual hangouts. I guess we should plan for when the weather is nice and the day isn't too packed.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:33:24.765039+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I know. What do you think of our old hangouts? Do you miss them as much as me?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:33:58.580068+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm not sure about that. I used to go there a lot in the old days, and it was always crowded but pleasant. The weather is cool, not freezing cold but still too warm. I would probably like to see some of their parks or gardens.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:34:36.574541+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I see. Are you serious about that? That's some impressive dedication.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:42:55.304676+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I'm serious about that.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:45:54.779128+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's a lot of work and dedication! How do you manage it all while also taking care of yourself?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:47:07.913794+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's amazing. I try to schedule regular check-ins with friends and family, but with work commitments, it's been tough for me lately.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:48:26.589022+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What is it that makes you think that's amazing, Olivia?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:57:43.879009+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What makes you think that's amazing?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:59:04.799151+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's incredible dedication!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T08:00:28.764387+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, that's amazing dedication! I could learn a thing or two from your approach. Maybe next time, you could let me know the day before so we can make it a date!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T08:01:54.579340+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I am honored and grateful to hear such positive words about my dedication.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T08:05:07.805241+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you for your kind words. I hope it's true, and I look forward to seeing you soon.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T08:07:59.392987+00:00"
    }
